#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:5
msgid "Actuators"
msgstr "执行器"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:7
msgid ""
"An articulated system moves through its actuated joints. Physical joints may"
" use active components, such as electric or hydraulic motors, or passive "
"components, such as springs and friction. These components can introduce "
"finite torque, speed limits, delays, and gearbox effects."
msgstr ""
"关节系统通过受驱动的关节运动。实际关节可以使用电机、液压马达等主动部件，也可以使用弹簧和摩擦等被动部件。这些部件会带来有限的输出力矩、速度限制、延迟和齿轮传动效应。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:11
msgid "Isaac Lab exposes two ways to reproduce that behavior in simulation:"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 提供两种方式，在仿真中复现这些行为："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Implicit actuators** pass position and velocity gains to the physics "
"engine, which runs a spring-damper (PD) controller in its solver. This is a "
"low-overhead option when the built-in PD model is sufficient. In isolation, "
"PhysX implicit drives may tolerate higher gains or a larger time step. "
"Contacts, mimic joints, joint limits, large target changes, and insufficient"
" solver convergence can still make them unstable. See the `PhysX "
"articulation drive stability guidance <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/PhysX/physx/5.8.0/docs/Articulations.html#articulation-"
"drive-stability>`_."
msgstr ""
"**隐式执行器** 将位置和速度增益传给物理引擎，由其求解器运行弹簧阻尼（PD）控制器。当内置 PD "
"模型已能满足需求时，这种方式开销较低。在不受其他因素影响时，PhysX "
"隐式驱动可能允许更高的增益或更大的时间步长。但接触、耦合关节、关节限位、大幅目标变化或求解器收敛不足，仍可能使其不稳定。参见 `PhysX "
"关节体驱动稳定性指南 <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/PhysX/physx/5.8.0/docs/Articulations.html#articulation-"
"drive-stability>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Explicit actuators** run a model that computes joint effort, clips it to "
"the motor's capabilities, and submits the result. They can model saturation,"
" delay, gearing, and learned motor behavior. Native paths process commands "
"differently: Newton processes them in the solver, while PhysX and OVPhysX "
"use a shared host adapter during ``write_data_to_sim()``."
msgstr ""
"**显式执行器** "
"运行模型，计算关节驱动力，将其限制在电机能力范围内，再提交结果。它可以模拟饱和、延迟、传动比和学习得到的电机行为。原生执行路径处理指令的方式不同：Newton"
" 在求解器中处理，而 PhysX 和 OVPhysX 在 ``write_data_to_sim()`` 期间通过共享的主机端适配器处理。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:24
msgid ""
"Actuator groups are configured through "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.actuators` and exposed at runtime "
"through :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection` on "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.actuators`. The collection routes "
"groups and stages commands and telemetry. The articulation executes and "
"submits them. LEAPP action terms still use the articulation setters; see "
":ref:`actuators-migrating-setters`."
msgstr ""
"执行器组通过 :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.actuators` 配置，运行时由 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.actuators` 上的 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection` "
"提供访问。该集合负责分发执行器组，并暂存指令和监测数据，由关节体执行并提交。LEAPP 动作项仍使用关节体的设置方法；参见 "
":ref:`actuators-migrating-setters` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:33
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:36
msgid "Quick usage"
msgstr "快速使用"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:38
msgid ""
"Declare one or more actuator groups in the articulation config. Each group "
"selects a disjoint set of joints by regular expression and chooses a model:"
msgstr "在关节体配置中声明一个或多个执行器组。每组通过正则表达式选择一组互不重叠的关节，并指定模型："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:58
msgid ""
"At runtime, send commands through "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection.target_command`. Position and "
"velocity commands are expressed in joint-side coordinates, and every command"
" buffer is indexed by articulation joint. The setters are keyword-only and "
"default to all environments and all joints:"
msgstr ""
"运行时通过 :attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection.target_command` "
"发送指令。位置和速度指令使用关节侧坐标，所有指令缓冲区都按关节体中的关节索引排列。设置方法只接受关键字参数，默认作用于全部环境和全部关节："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:70
msgid ""
"The articulation stages and submits actuator commands inside "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.write_data_to_sim`. Isaac Lab-managed "
"models and the shared host adapter run during this call. Newton-native "
"controllers finish processing inside the solver. The following sections "
"describe this pipeline, the available models, and their parameters."
msgstr ""
"关节体在 :meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.write_data_to_sim` "
"中暂存并提交执行器指令。Isaac Lab 管理的模型和共享主机端适配器在此调用期间运行；Newton "
"原生控制器在求解器内完成处理。以下章节介绍这一流程、可用模型及其参数。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:79
msgid "The actuator pipeline"
msgstr "执行器处理流程"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:81
msgid ""
"Setting an actuator command does not write directly to the solver. Commands "
"first enter the collection. Each group then follows one of three execution "
"paths:"
msgstr "设置执行器指令不会直接写入求解器。指令先进入集合，然后各组选择以下三种执行路径之一："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Command view** -- ``actuators.target_command.set_*_index`` and ``_mask`` "
"write desired position, velocity, and effort into joint-indexed buffers."
msgstr ""
"**指令视图** — ``actuators.target_command.set_*_index`` 和 ``_mask`` "
"将期望位置、速度和驱动力写入按关节索引排列的缓冲区。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:86
msgid ""
"**ActuatorCollection** -- routes groups and stages full-articulation "
"commands, processed joint commands, and telemetry. Actuator models retain "
"their own gains and temporary state."
msgstr ""
"**ActuatorCollection** — 分发执行器组，并暂存整个关节体的指令、处理后的关节指令和监测数据。执行器模型自行维护增益和临时状态。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Execution path** -- an Isaac Lab explicit model computes and clips effort,"
" an implicit drive applies targets with solver-side PD gains, or a native "
"actuator runs through Newton or the shared host adapter."
msgstr ""
"**执行路径** — Isaac Lab 显式模型计算并限幅驱动力；隐式驱动使用求解器侧的 PD 增益应用目标；原生执行器则通过 Newton "
"或共享主机端适配器运行。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:92
msgid ""
"For Isaac Lab-managed models, ``actuators.output_command`` contains the "
"processed position, velocity, and effort submitted to the backend. Native "
"paths bypass this view, so it is not submitted-command telemetry for them. "
"PhysX and OVPhysX process commands during ``write_data_to_sim()``, while "
"Newton-native controllers process them inside the solver. See "
":ref:`actuators-native` for supported native models and limitations."
msgstr ""
"对于 Isaac Lab 管理的模型， ``actuators.output_command`` "
"包含提交给后端的、处理后的位置、速度和驱动力。原生路径绕过此视图，因此它不能反映原生路径实际提交的指令。PhysX 和 OVPhysX 在 "
"``write_data_to_sim()`` 期间处理指令，Newton 原生控制器则在求解器内处理。受支持的原生模型及限制见 "
":ref:`actuators-native` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:98 source/concepts/actuators.rst:106
msgid ""
"Three actuator paths: Lab-managed models execute before submission, implicit drives\n"
"execute in the solver, and native models execute in the Newton/MJWarp solver or in the\n"
"shared PhysX/OVPhysX host adapter before submission."
msgstr ""
"三种执行器路径：Lab 管理的模型在提交前执行；隐式驱动在求解器中执行；原生模型在 Newton/MJWarp 求解器中执行，或在提交前由共享的 "
"PhysX/OVPhysX 主机端适配器执行。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:114
msgid "Implicit and explicit groups store gains differently:"
msgstr "隐式组和显式组以不同方式存储增益："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:116
msgid ""
"For an **implicit** group, "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.stiffness` and "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.damping` are written to the "
"solver, which runs the PD law. ``compute()`` passes the desired targets "
"through unchanged while recording an approximate torque for telemetry."
msgstr ""
"对于 **隐式** 组， :attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.stiffness` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.damping` 写入求解器，由求解器执行 PD 控制律。 "
"``compute()`` 原样传递期望目标，同时记录近似力矩作为监测数据。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:120
msgid ""
"For an **explicit** group, the same gains are consumed by the model to "
"compute a torque, and the solver's own PD gains for those joints are set to "
"zero. Reading ``data.joint_stiffness`` or ``data.joint_damping`` on an "
"explicit joint therefore returns **zero** -- the gains live in the actuator "
"model, not the solver."
msgstr ""
"对于 **显式** 组，模型使用相同的增益计算力矩，而求解器中这些关节自身的 PD 增益设为零。因此，在显式关节上读取 "
"``data.joint_stiffness`` 或 ``data.joint_damping`` 会返回 **零** — "
"增益存储在执行器模型中，而不在求解器中。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:125
msgid ""
"Gains configured for an actuator group are separate from "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.joint_stiffness` and "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.joint_damping`. Those data fields "
"report solver drive gains. They match implicit gains after initialization "
"and are zero for explicit actuator joints. They do not mirror actuator-model"
" gains."
msgstr ""
"执行器组配置的增益与 :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.joint_stiffness` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.joint_damping` "
"分开维护。这两个数据字段报告求解器驱动增益：初始化后，它们与隐式增益一致；对于显式执行器关节则为零。它们不会同步反映执行器模型的增益。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:135
msgid "Joint and actuator property ownership"
msgstr "关节和执行器属性的归属"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:137
msgid ""
"An actuator configuration selects joints and can override their properties "
"during construction. Isaac Lab resolves ``joint_effort_limit``, "
"``joint_velocity_limit``, armature, friction, and implicit drive gains when "
"it builds the articulation. :class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData` holds"
" the live values, including ``joint_effort_limits``, ``joint_vel_limits``, "
"``joint_armature``, and supported friction properties. Use articulation data"
" and joint writers to read or change them. "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection` has no joint-property API."
msgstr ""
"执行器配置选择关节，并可在构造时覆盖其属性。Isaac Lab 构建关节体时会解析 ``joint_effort_limit`` 、 "
"``joint_velocity_limit`` 、电枢惯量、摩擦和隐式驱动增益。 "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData` 保存实时值，包括 ``joint_effort_limits`` "
"、 ``joint_vel_limits`` 、 ``joint_armature`` "
"和受支持的摩擦属性。请通过关节体数据和关节写入方法读取或修改它们。 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection` 不提供关节属性 API。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:145
msgid ""
"The runtime group properties ``effort_limit_sim``, ``velocity_limit_sim``, "
"``armature``, ``friction``, ``dynamic_friction``, and ``viscous_friction`` "
"were removed. Read their live values from articulation data and use the "
"corresponding joint writers. The deprecated ``effort_limit_sim`` and "
"``velocity_limit_sim`` configuration aliases remain available through 3.x. "
"See :ref:`actuators-solver-limit-migration` for replacement data views and "
"writers."
msgstr ""
"运行时的执行器组属性 ``effort_limit_sim`` 、 ``velocity_limit_sim`` 、 ``armature`` 、 "
"``friction`` 、 ``dynamic_friction`` 和 ``viscous_friction`` "
"已移除。请从关节体数据读取实时值，并使用对应的关节写入方法。已弃用的配置别名 ``effort_limit_sim`` 和 "
"``velocity_limit_sim`` 在 3.x 期间仍可使用。替代的数据视图和写入方法见 :ref:`actuators-solver-"
"limit-migration` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:151
msgid ""
"Explicit actuators store model state such as ``actuator_effort_limit``, "
"rated ``actuator_velocity_limit``, gains, delay, and motor curves. They do "
"not store separate solver-limit or friction values. Because the backend runs"
" their drives, implicit actuators read stiffness, damping, and effort "
"projection from live articulation properties; assigning to these properties "
"is ignored with a warning — use the articulation joint writers or the "
"``randomize_actuator_gains`` event instead."
msgstr ""
"显式执行器保存模型状态，例如 ``actuator_effort_limit`` 、额定 ``actuator_velocity_limit`` "
"、增益、延迟和电机曲线，不再单独存储求解器限制或摩擦值。隐式执行器的驱动由后端运行，因此它们从关节体的实时属性读取刚度、阻尼和驱动力投影；直接为这些属性赋值会被忽略并发出警告，请改用关节体的关节写入方法或"
" ``randomize_actuator_gains`` 事件。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:157
msgid ""
"Newton-executed groups have no Isaac Lab model at all: the collection "
"mapping entry is the owning Newton ``Actuator`` object, whose controller "
"keeps its parameters separate from solver gains. Read or modify its "
"components (``controller``, ``delay``, ``clamping``) directly for raw "
"access, or use :func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.read_group_parameter` and "
":func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.write_group_parameter` for group-scoped "
"access in public joint order with environment selection."
msgstr ""
"由 Newton 执行的组完全没有 Isaac Lab 模型：集合中的映射条目就是所属的 Newton ``Actuator`` "
"对象，其控制器将自身参数与求解器增益分开维护。如需直接访问，可读取或修改其组件（ ``controller`` 、 ``delay`` 、 "
"``clamping`` ）；也可使用 :func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.read_group_parameter` "
"和 :func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.write_group_parameter` "
"，按公共关节顺序访问指定组，并选择环境。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:164
msgid ""
"``actuator_effort_limit`` and ``actuator_velocity_limit`` apply to the "
"actuator model. ``joint_effort_limit`` and ``joint_velocity_limit`` apply to"
" the joint or solver and can have different values. Explicit models clip "
"output to ``actuator_effort_limit``; ``joint_effort_limit`` limits the "
"solver. ``actuator_velocity_limit`` is the model's rated joint-side speed, "
"or a soft-limit snapshot for implicit actuators. ``joint_velocity_limit`` "
"requests a solver constraint. Because backends enforce it differently, "
"solver velocity limits are not portable clamps. ``effort_limit`` and "
"``velocity_limit`` are deprecated configuration and runtime group aliases. "
"``velocity_limit`` resolves to ``actuator_velocity_limit``; ``effort_limit``"
" resolves to ``actuator_effort_limit``. An implicit group may configure "
"``actuator_effort_limit`` separately from ``joint_effort_limit`` to keep a "
"rated model-facing limit distinct from the solver clamp; when unset, it "
"tracks the live solver limit."
msgstr ""
"``actuator_effort_limit`` 和 ``actuator_velocity_limit`` 作用于执行器模型； "
"``joint_effort_limit`` 和 ``joint_velocity_limit`` "
"作用于关节或求解器，两者可以取不同值。显式模型将输出限制在 ``actuator_effort_limit`` 内， "
"``joint_effort_limit`` 则限制求解器。 ``actuator_velocity_limit`` "
"是模型的关节侧额定速度，对于隐式执行器则是软速度限制的快照。 ``joint_velocity_limit`` "
"请求求解器约束。各后端的实现不同，因此求解器速度限制不能作为通用的速度限幅机制。 ``effort_limit`` 和 "
"``velocity_limit`` 是已弃用的配置及运行时组别名，分别解析为 ``actuator_effort_limit`` 和 "
"``actuator_velocity_limit`` 。隐式组可以分别配置 ``actuator_effort_limit`` 和 "
"``joint_effort_limit`` ，区分模型额定上限与求解器限幅；未设置时，前者跟随实时求解器限制。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:178
msgid "Choosing a model"
msgstr "选择模型"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:180
msgid ""
"All models use :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg`. PD models "
"differ in clipping and state. Neural models replace the analytical PD law "
"with a learned torque predictor. Choose the simplest model that meets your "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"所有模型均使用 :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg` 。各 PD "
"模型的区别在于限幅方式和状态。神经网络模型用学习得到的力矩预测器替代解析 PD 控制律。请选择能够满足需求的最简单模型。"

