msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.RemotizedPDActuator` "
"(:class:`~isaaclab.actuators.RemotizedPDActuatorCfg`)"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:214
msgid "Delayed PD with an angle-dependent torque ceiling."
msgstr "延迟 PD，力矩上限随角度变化。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:215
msgid "Torque clipped by a joint-angle lookup table."
msgstr "通过关节角度查找表限制力矩。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:216
msgid "``joint_parameter_lookup``"
msgstr "``joint_parameter_lookup``"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:217
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetMLP` / "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetLSTM`"
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetMLP` / "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetLSTM`"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:219
msgid "A trained network predicts the torque from the joint history."
msgstr "训练好的网络根据关节历史预测力矩。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:220
msgid "Network output clipped by the DC-motor envelope."
msgstr "网络输出根据直流电机包络限幅。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:221
msgid "``network_file`` (+ input scaling)"
msgstr "``network_file`` （以及输入缩放）"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:223
msgid ""
"**ImplicitActuator.** The default model. The solver applies the gains and "
"limits. Isaac Lab estimates effort telemetry from the current state when the"
" backend does not expose it."
msgstr ""
"**ImplicitActuator。** 默认模型。由求解器应用增益和限制。后端未提供驱动力监测值时，Isaac Lab 根据当前状态进行估计。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:226
msgid ""
"**IdealPDActuator.** An explicit PD controller with feed-forward effort and "
"a symmetric model-side torque limit at :math:`\\pm\\,\\tau_{max}`."
msgstr ""
"**IdealPDActuator。** 带前馈驱动力的显式 PD 控制器，模型侧的对称力矩上限为 :math:`\\pm\\,\\tau_{max}`"
" 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:229
msgid ""
"**DCMotor.** Adds a linear four-quadrant torque-speed curve. "
"``saturation_effort`` is the stall torque, and ``actuator_velocity_limit`` "
"is the no-load speed. Both accept a joint-name-pattern dictionary, so joints"
" behind different gear reductions can share one group and still get their "
"own curve — for example a quadruped whose knee sits behind an extra "
"reduction relative to its hip."
msgstr ""
"**DCMotor。** 添加线性的四象限力矩-速度曲线。 ``saturation_effort`` 是堵转力矩， "
"``actuator_velocity_limit`` "
"是空载速度。两者都接受以关节名称模式为键的字典，因此不同减速比后的关节可以共享一个组，同时拥有各自的曲线，例如四足机器人中膝关节比髋关节多一级减速的情况。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:234
msgid ""
"**DelayedPDActuator.** An ideal PD controller with delayed position, "
"velocity, and effort commands. The delay is sampled uniformly from "
"``[min_delay, max_delay]`` at reset."
msgstr ""
"**DelayedPDActuator。** 对位置、速度和驱动力指令加入延迟的理想 PD 控制器。重置时从 ``[min_delay, "
"max_delay]`` 均匀采样延迟。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:237
msgid ""
"**RemotizedPDActuator.** A delayed PD controller with an angle-dependent "
"torque limit. The ``joint_parameter_lookup`` table stores joint angle, "
"transmission ratio, and maximum torque. Use it for linkages whose effective "
"lever arm changes through their range of motion."
msgstr ""
"**RemotizedPDActuator。** 带角度相关力矩限制的延迟 PD 控制器。 ``joint_parameter_lookup`` "
"表存储关节角度、传动比和最大力矩，适用于有效力臂随运动范围变化的连杆机构。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:241
msgid ""
"**ActuatorNetMLP / ActuatorNetLSTM.** Learned torque models that use joint-"
"position error and velocity history and clip output with the DC-motor "
"envelope. They require a TorchScript checkpoint. See the "
":mod:`isaaclab.actuators` API reference for configuration details."
msgstr ""
"**ActuatorNetMLP / ActuatorNetLSTM。** "
"学习得到的力矩模型，使用关节位置误差和速度历史，并通过直流电机包络限制输出。它们需要 TorchScript 检查点。配置详情见 "
":mod:`isaaclab.actuators` API 参考。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:249
msgid "Parameter reference"
msgstr "参数参考"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:251
msgid ""
"Each subsection compares five actuators while varying one parameter. All "
"clips use a single-joint pendulum stepped at :math:`dt = 1/360\\text{ s}`, "
"with commands issued at 60 Hz. The stiffness, damping, and armature sweeps "
"use the *implicit* path."
msgstr ""
"各小节在改变一个参数的同时，对比五个执行器。所有片段均使用单关节摆，时间步长为 :math:`dt = 1/360\\text{ s}` ，以 60 "
"Hz 发送指令。刚度、阻尼和电枢惯量的参数扫描使用 *隐式* 路径。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:257
msgid ""
"**Explicit groups keep the solver effort limit.** The solver retains the "
"authored :attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.joint_effort_limit` for "
"explicit groups, so effort submitted by an explicit model is clipped a "
"second time by the solver. Configure ``joint_effort_limit`` at least as "
"large as ``actuator_effort_limit`` when the model should be the only clip. "
"See :ref:`actuators-joint-property-ownership` for model-limit, joint-limit, "
"and implicit-alias semantics."
msgstr ""
"**显式组仍保留求解器驱动力限制。** 对于显式组，求解器保留已设置的 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.joint_effort_limit` "
"，因此显式模型提交的驱动力会被求解器再次限幅。如果只希望由模型限幅，请将 ``joint_effort_limit`` 设为不小于 "
"``actuator_effort_limit`` 的值。模型限制、关节限制和隐式别名的语义见 :ref:`actuators-joint-"
"property-ownership` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:266
msgid "Stiffness"
msgstr "刚度"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:268
msgid ""
"Stiffness (:math:`k_p`, the proportional gain) controls how strongly the "
"joint moves toward its position target. Higher stiffness improves tracking "
"but can increase overshoot and oscillation. Too little stiffness leaves "
"steady-state error under load. Tune stiffness together with damping. Units "
"are [N·m/rad] for revolute joints and [N/m] for prismatic joints."
msgstr ""
"刚度（ :math:`k_p` "
"，比例增益）控制关节向位置目标运动的力度。较高刚度可改善跟踪，但可能增加超调和振荡。刚度过小则会在负载下产生稳态误差。应结合阻尼一起调节刚度。旋转关节的单位为"
" [N·m/rad]，移动关节为 [N/m]。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:273
msgid "Five pendulums with increasing stiffness stepping to the same target."
msgstr "五个刚度逐渐增大的摆，阶跃到同一目标。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:278 source/concepts/actuators.rst:284
msgid "Position step response for a stiffness sweep."
msgstr "刚度参数扫描的位置阶跃响应。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:292
msgid "Damping"
msgstr "阻尼"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:294
msgid ""
"Damping (:math:`k_d`, the derivative gain) resists joint velocity. Too "
"little damping allows a stiff joint to oscillate. More damping reduces "
"overshoot until the joint becomes critically damped; beyond that point, the "
"response becomes sluggish. Damping also sets the tracking gain for velocity "
"targets. Units are [N·m·s/rad] for revolute joints and [N·s/m] for prismatic"
" joints."
msgstr ""
"阻尼（ :math:`k_d` "
"，微分增益）抵抗关节速度。阻尼过小会使高刚度关节振荡。增大阻尼可减小超调，直到达到临界阻尼；再继续增大，响应会变得迟缓。阻尼也决定速度目标的跟踪增益。旋转关节的单位为"
" [N·m·s/rad]，移动关节为 [N·s/m]。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:299
msgid ""
"Five pendulums from underdamped to overdamped stepping to the same target."
msgstr "五个从欠阻尼到过阻尼的摆，阶跃到同一目标。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:304 source/concepts/actuators.rst:310
msgid "Position step response for a damping sweep."
msgstr "阻尼参数扫描的位置阶跃响应。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:317
msgid ""
"Try the :ref:`interactive PD tuning demo <interactive-demo-joint-pd>` to "
"adjust stiffness and damping on a suspended arm with step and sine commands."
" Its live plot compares target and measured angles. Tune a real robot using "
"its own mass, actuator model, effort limits, and timestep."
msgstr ""
"可以先试试 :ref:`交互式 PD 调参演示 <interactive-demo-joint-pd>` "
"：向悬挂的机械臂输入阶跃或正弦指令，调整刚度和阻尼，并在实时曲线中对比目标角度和实测角度。为真实机器人调参时，应使用它自身的质量、执行器模型、力/力矩限制和时间步长。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:324
msgid "Armature"
msgstr "电枢惯量"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:326
msgid ""
"Armature [kg or kg·m², depending on joint type] represents the reflected "
"inertia of the motor and gearbox. It is added to the joint-space inertia, so"
" it changes the physical model. In this single-joint comparison, more "
"armature slows the response and increases the stability margin for the "
"selected gains. It can also improve numerical conditioning for low-inertia "
"joints."
msgstr ""
"电枢惯量 [kg 或 kg·m²，取决于关节类型] "
"表示折算到关节侧的电机和齿轮箱惯量。它被加到关节空间惯量上，因此会改变物理模型。在此单关节对比中，增大电枢惯量会减慢响应，并提高所选增益下的稳定裕度。对于低惯量关节，它还可以改善数值条件。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:331
msgid ""
"Explicit and implicit actuators may require different stability settings "
"because explicit models submit effort while implicit models use solver "
"drives. If an explicit simulation diverges, check mass and inertia, target "
"scaling and update rate, effort limits, gains, time step, and solver "
"convergence. Choose armature from the motor and transmission model. See the "
"`OmniPhysics articulation stability guide "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/dev_guide/guides/articulation_stability_guide.html>`_"
" for more information."
msgstr ""
"显式和隐式执行器可能需要不同的稳定性设置，因为显式模型提交驱动力，而隐式模型使用求解器驱动。如果显式仿真发散，请检查质量和惯量、目标缩放及更新频率、驱动力限制、增益、时间步长和求解器收敛情况。电枢惯量应根据电机和传动模型确定。更多信息见"
" `OmniPhysics 关节体稳定性指南 "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/dev_guide/guides/articulation_stability_guide.html>`_"
" 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:338
msgid ""
"Five pendulums with increasing armature responding to the same command."
msgstr "五个电枢惯量逐渐增大的摆，对同一指令作出响应。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:343 source/concepts/actuators.rst:349
msgid "Position step response for an armature sweep."
msgstr "电枢惯量参数扫描的位置阶跃响应。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:357
msgid "Friction"
msgstr "摩擦"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:359
msgid ""
"Joint friction acts independently of the PD command. On a freely spinning "
"joint, higher friction removes velocity faster. Isaac Lab supports static "
"(:attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.friction`), dynamic "
"(:attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.dynamic_friction`), and viscous "
"(:attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.viscous_friction`) friction. Use"
" it to model gearbox stiction and drag, not to stabilize a controller."
msgstr ""
"关节摩擦独立于 PD 指令起作用。对自由旋转的关节，更大的摩擦会使速度更快衰减。Isaac Lab 支持静摩擦（ "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.friction` ）、动摩擦（ "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.dynamic_friction` ）和黏性摩擦（ "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.viscous_friction` "
"）。应使用它来模拟齿轮箱的静摩擦和拖曳阻力，而不是稳定控制器。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:368
msgid ""
"Friction conventions depend on the backend. PhysX uses dimensionless static "
"and dynamic coefficients in Isaac Sim 4.5, and effort values [N or N·m, "
"depending on joint type] in 5.0 and later. OVPhysX uses dimensionless static"
" and dynamic coefficients. Newton uses a dry-friction effort and has no "
"separate dynamic-friction value. All three use viscous damping [N·s/m or "
"N·m·s/rad, depending on joint type]."
msgstr ""
"摩擦约定取决于后端。PhysX 在 Isaac Sim 4.5 中使用无量纲的静摩擦和动摩擦系数，在 5.0 及之后的版本中使用驱动力数值 [N 或 "
"N·m，取决于关节类型]。OVPhysX 使用无量纲的静摩擦和动摩擦系数。Newton 使用干摩擦驱动力，没有独立的动摩擦值。三者均使用黏性阻尼 "
"[N·s/m 或 N·m·s/rad，取决于关节类型]。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:374
msgid ""
"Five free-spinning pendulums with increasing joint friction decaying at "
"different rates."
msgstr "五个关节摩擦逐渐增大的自由旋转摆，以不同速率减速。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:379 source/concepts/actuators.rst:385
msgid "Joint-velocity decay for a friction sweep."
msgstr "摩擦参数扫描的关节速度衰减。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:393
msgid "Effort limit"
msgstr "驱动力上限"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:395
msgid ""
"The effort limit is the torque ceiling the motor can produce [N·m or N]. The"
" clip below drives an :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.IdealPDActuator` swing-up "
"from hanging to horizontal against a ~2.94 N·m gravity-hold torque, with the"
" model's ``actuator_effort_limit`` swept over :math:`[1, 2, 3, 4, 6]` N·m."
msgstr ""
"驱动力上限是电机能产生的最大力矩或力 [N·m 或 N]。下方片段使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.IdealPDActuator` ，将摆从下垂位置摆起到水平位置，克服约 2.94 N·m "
"的重力保持力矩。模型的 ``actuator_effort_limit`` 依次取 :math:`[1, 2, 3, 4, 6]` N·m。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:400
msgid ""
"The limit shapes the transient response, while gravity determines the steady"
" state. Limits above the approximately 2.94 N·m hold torque reach the "
"horizontal target. Lower limits leave the joint below it, where gravity "
"torque (:math:`\\approx 2.94 \\sin\\theta`) matches the limit. When the PD "
"demand exceeds the limit, the applied torque and damping term are both "
"clipped. The joint can therefore oscillate until the demand returns within "
"the limit. An effort limit below the load's static demand prevents the "
"controller from damping the joint effectively."
msgstr ""
"该上限影响瞬态响应，而重力决定稳态。上限高于约 2.94 N·m 的保持力矩时，摆能达到水平目标；上限较低时，关节停在目标下方，重力力矩（ "
":math:`\\approx 2.94 \\sin\\theta` ）与上限平衡。PD "
"需求超过上限时，施加的力矩和阻尼项都会被限幅，因此关节可能持续振荡，直到需求回到上限内。如果驱动力上限低于负载的静态需求，控制器就无法有效抑制关节振荡。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:407
msgid ""
"Five pendulums with increasing effort limit holding or failing against "
"gravity."
msgstr "五个驱动力上限逐渐增大的摆，能够或不能抵抗重力保持位置。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:412 source/concepts/actuators.rst:418
msgid "Applied joint torque for an effort-limit sweep."
msgstr "驱动力上限参数扫描的实际关节力矩。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:426
msgid "Velocity limit"
msgstr "速度上限"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:428
msgid ""
"For a :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.DCMotor`, ``actuator_velocity_limit`` is "
"the no-load speed [rad/s or m/s]. Torque decreases as the joint approaches "
"this speed, forming the four-quadrant torque-speed envelope. Lower limits "
"reduce the usable speed range and cause earlier clipping. For an implicit "
"group, the value is exposed through the soft velocity-limit view. "
"``joint_velocity_limit`` instead requests a solver constraint. Enforcement "
"depends on the backend; see :ref:`newton-velocity-limits`."
msgstr ""
"对于 :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.DCMotor` ， ``actuator_velocity_limit`` 是空载速度 "
"[rad/s 或 m/s]。关节接近该速度时力矩减小，形成四象限力矩-"
"速度包络。较低上限会缩小可用速度范围，使限幅更早发生。对于隐式组，该值通过软速度限制视图提供。 ``joint_velocity_limit`` "
"则请求求解器约束，其实施方式取决于后端；参见 :ref:`newton-velocity-limits` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:435 source/concepts/actuators.rst:441
msgid "Torque-speed envelope for a velocity-limit sweep."
msgstr "速度上限参数扫描的力矩-速度包络。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:449
msgid "Command delay"
msgstr "指令延迟"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:451
msgid ""
"A :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.DelayedPDActuator` delays every command by a "
"fixed number of physics steps sampled from ``[min_delay, max_delay]`` at "
"reset. The clip compares delays of :math:`[0, 6, 12, 24, 48]` steps (0--133 "
"ms at :math:`dt = 1/360\\text{ s}`) for a square-wave position command. "
"Longer delays make the pendulum trail the reference. Randomizing delay "
"between resets can model transport delay during sim-to-real training."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.DelayedPDActuator` 将每条指令延迟固定数量的物理步，该数量在重置时从 "
"``[min_delay, max_delay]`` 采样。片段对比方波位置指令下 :math:`[0, 6, 12, 24, 48]` 步的延迟（在 "
":math:`dt = 1/360\\text{ s}` 时对应 0–133 "
"ms）。延迟越长，摆越滞后于参考信号。在两次重置之间随机改变延迟，可以在仿真到现实训练中模拟传输延迟。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:457
msgid ""
"Five pendulums with increasing command delay trailing the same square-wave "
"command."
msgstr "五个指令延迟逐渐增大的摆，滞后于同一方波指令。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:462 source/concepts/actuators.rst:468
msgid "Command-versus-response timeline for a delay sweep."
msgstr "延迟参数扫描的指令与响应时间线。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:476
msgid "Implicit vs. explicit"
msgstr "隐式与显式的对比"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:478
msgid ""
"In this single-joint demo at :math:`dt = 1/360\\text{ s}`, implicit and "
"ideal-PD explicit actuators with identical gains produce nearly the same "
"response. Outside this example, their response and stability can differ. The"
" solver applies the implicit drive, whereas the explicit model evaluates PD "
"once per step. Policies trained with implicit actuators may therefore need "
"adjustment for explicit actuators. For explicit joints, "
"``data.joint_stiffness`` and ``data.joint_damping`` are zero because the "
"gains belong to the actuator model."
msgstr ""
"在这个时间步长为 :math:`dt = 1/360\\text{ s}` 的单关节演示中，采用相同增益的隐式执行器和理想 PD "
"显式执行器产生几乎相同的响应。在其他情况下，两者的响应和稳定性可能不同。求解器负责应用隐式驱动，而显式模型每一步计算一次 "
"PD。因此，使用隐式执行器训练的策略可能需要调整后才能用于显式执行器。对于显式关节， ``data.joint_stiffness`` 和 "
"``data.joint_damping`` 为零，因为增益属于执行器模型。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:485 source/concepts/actuators.rst:491
msgid "Overlaid implicit and explicit PD step responses at identical gains."
msgstr "相同增益下，隐式和显式 PD 阶跃响应的叠加对比。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:501
msgid "Runtime API: ``articulation.actuators``"
msgstr "运行时 API： ``articulation.actuators``"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:504
msgid "Group access"
msgstr "访问执行器组"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:506
msgid ""
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.actuators` is an "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection`, a read-only ``Mapping`` "
"from group name to whoever owns the group. Isaac Lab-executed groups map to "
"their :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBase` model instances. Newton-"
"executed groups map to the Newton ``Actuator`` objects that drive their "
"joints — no Isaac Lab model exists for them, so their controller parameters "
"are read and modified on the owning object (see :ref:`actuators-native`). "
"Membership is fixed after construction, so you can look up and iterate "
"groups but not add, replace, or delete them:"
msgstr ""
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.actuators` 是 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection` ，以只读 ``Mapping`` "
"将组名映射到负责该组的对象。Isaac Lab 执行的组映射到其 :class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBase` "
"模型实例。Newton 执行的组映射到驱动其关节的 Newton ``Actuator`` 对象 — 这类组没有 Isaac Lab "
"模型，因此应在所属对象上读取和修改控制器参数（见 :ref:`actuators-native` "
"）。组成员在构造后固定，允许查找和遍历，但不能添加、替换或删除："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:522
msgid "Configure topology before creating the articulation:"
msgstr "创建关节体前配置拓扑："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:529
msgid ""
"At runtime, both ``robot.actuators[\"gripper\"] = ...`` and ``del "
"robot.actuators[\"gripper\"]`` raise :class:`TypeError`. Group membership "
"and joint coverage are fixed when the articulation is created."
msgstr ""
"运行时， ``robot.actuators[\"gripper\"] = ...`` 和 ``del "
"robot.actuators[\"gripper\"]`` 都会抛出 :class:`TypeError` "
"。组成员和关节覆盖范围在创建关节体时就已固定。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:534
msgid "Logical groups and execution batches"
msgstr "逻辑组与执行批次"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:536
msgid ""
"Named groups such as ``hips`` and ``knees`` remain distinct when you "
"configure or access them. A single internal executor computes all plain "
"implicit groups in one fused kernel launch without changing the tensors "
"returned by ``robot.actuators[\"hips\"]``. Each joint may belong to only one"
" group; overlapping selections raise :class:`ValueError`. Explicit, "
"stateful, neural, and subclassed groups execute one group at a time on the "
"Isaac Lab path, and Newton-executed groups run inside the solver or host "
"adapter. Fused execution is an internal optimization."
msgstr ""
"配置或访问时， ``hips`` 和 ``knees`` 等命名组仍相互独立。单个内部执行器通过一次融合内核调用计算所有普通隐式组，不改变 "
"``robot.actuators[\"hips\"]`` 返回的张量。每个关节只能属于一个组，选择范围重叠会抛出 "
":class:`ValueError` 。在 Isaac Lab 路径上，显式、有状态、神经网络及派生类组逐组执行；Newton "
"执行的组则在求解器或主机端适配器中运行。融合执行属于内部优化。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:544
msgid "Commands, telemetry, and lifecycle"
msgstr "指令、监测数据与生命周期"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:546
msgid ""
"**Setting actuator commands.** The mutable ``target_command`` view contains "
"the desired position, velocity, and effort. Use index setters with "
"environment or joint index lists and tensors. Use mask setters when you "
"already have boolean Warp masks. All setters are keyword-only:"
msgstr ""
"**设置执行器指令。** 可修改的 ``target_command`` "
"视图包含期望位置、速度和驱动力。已有环境或关节索引列表及张量时，使用索引设置方法；已有布尔 Warp "
"掩码时，使用掩码设置方法。所有设置方法只接受关键字参数："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:559
msgid ""
"``env_ids`` and ``joint_ids`` must not contain duplicates. Duplicate indices"
" write to the same destination concurrently, so the result is undefined. "
"Remove duplicates or use a boolean mask, which selects each destination at "
"most once."
msgstr ""
"``env_ids`` 和 ``joint_ids`` "
"不能包含重复项。重复索引会并发写入同一目标，结果未定义。请去除重复项，或使用布尔掩码，使各目标最多被选中一次。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:563
msgid ""
"By default, ``value`` has shape ``(len(env_ids), len(joint_ids))``. Pass "
"``full_data=True`` when ``value`` already has shape ``(num_instances, "
"num_joints)``. The setter then reads the selected values directly from the "
"full buffer."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下， ``value`` 的形状为 ``(len(env_ids), len(joint_ids))`` 。如果 ``value`` 已具有 "
"``(num_instances, num_joints)`` 形状，请传入 ``full_data=True`` "
"，设置方法会直接从完整缓冲区读取所选值。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:567
msgid ""
"**Reading commands and telemetry.** ``target_command`` contains the desired "
"values staged for actuator processing. For Isaac Lab-managed models, "
"``output_command`` contains the processed joint commands. Native paths "
"bypass this view, so it does not show submitted commands. Newton processes "
"commands in the solver, while PhysX and OVPhysX process them through the "
"shared host adapter during ``write_data_to_sim()``. Access the arrays "
"through ``.torch`` or ``.warp``:"
msgstr ""
"**读取指令和监测数据。** ``target_command`` 包含暂存的期望值，等待执行器处理。对于 Isaac Lab 管理的模型， "
"``output_command`` 包含处理后的关节指令。原生路径绕过该视图，因此它不会显示已提交的指令。Newton 在求解器中处理指令，PhysX"
" 和 OVPhysX 则在 ``write_data_to_sim()`` 期间通过共享主机端适配器处理。通过 ``.torch`` 或 "
"``.warp`` 访问数组："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:581
msgid ""
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection.computed_effort` is the model "
"output before clipping. "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection.applied_effort` is the value "
"after clipping. For implicit actuators, these are approximate efforts "
"recorded for rewards and telemetry."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection.computed_effort` 是限幅前的模型输出， "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorCollection.applied_effort` "
"是限幅后的值。对于隐式执行器，它们是为奖励计算和监测记录的近似驱动力。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:585
msgid ""
"**Randomizing gains.** Gain updates depend on the actuator implementation. "
"Managed environments should use the ``randomize_actuator_gains`` event. It "
"updates actuator-owned gains, implicit solver drives, or native-controller "
"parameters as appropriate. There is no generic collection-level stiffness or"
" damping writer."
msgstr ""
"**随机化增益。** 增益更新方式取决于执行器实现。由管理器组织的环境应使用 ``randomize_actuator_gains`` "
"事件，它会按需更新执行器自身的增益、隐式求解器驱动或原生控制器参数。集合层没有通用的刚度或阻尼写入方法。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:590
msgid ""
"**Lifecycle.** Do not call ``compute()`` or ``submit_commands()`` directly. "
"The articulation resets actuators during environment resets. It runs "
"actuator compute, staging, and submission from "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.write_data_to_sim`. Call this method "
"before advancing the simulation, or let the scene or environment loop call "
"it. The effort telemetry reflects its most recent call. Newton-native "
"processing continues inside the solver; host-adapter processing finishes "
"during the call."
msgstr ""
"**生命周期。** 请勿直接调用 ``compute()`` 或 ``submit_commands()`` 。关节体在环境重置时重置执行器，并通过 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.write_data_to_sim` "
"完成执行器计算、暂存和提交。应在推进仿真前调用该方法，或由场景/环境循环调用。驱动力监测数据反映最近一次调用的结果。Newton "
"原生处理会在求解器内继续进行；主机端适配器处理则在此调用期间完成。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:600
msgid "Migrating from the deprecated setters"
msgstr "从已弃用的设置方法迁移"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:601
msgid ""
"Joint commands were previously set on the articulation. Those methods now "
"forward to the collection and emit a :class:`DeprecationWarning`:"
msgstr "以前在关节体上设置关节指令。这些方法现在将调用转发给集合，并发出 :class:`DeprecationWarning` ："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:612
msgid ""
"LEAPP-exported action terms must keep using the annotated articulation "
"``*_index`` or ``*_mask`` setters until the exporter supports collection "
"setters. Other runtime code should migrate to the collection API."
msgstr ""
"在导出器支持集合设置方法之前，LEAPP 导出的动作项必须继续使用带注解的关节体 ``*_index`` 或 ``*_mask`` "
"设置方法。其他运行时代码应迁移到集合 API。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:616
msgid ""
"The data accessors also moved: ``articulation.data.joint_pos_target`` "
"becomes ``robot.actuators.target_command.position``, and "
"``data.computed_torque`` / ``data.applied_torque`` become "
"``robot.actuators.computed_effort`` / ``robot.actuators.applied_effort``. "
"See the :doc:`Isaac Lab 3.0 migration guide "
"<../migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0>` for the full table."
msgstr ""
"数据访问器也已迁移： ``articulation.data.joint_pos_target`` 改为 "
"``robot.actuators.target_command.position`` ， ``data.computed_torque`` / "
"``data.applied_torque`` 改为 ``robot.actuators.computed_effort`` / "
"``robot.actuators.applied_effort`` 。完整对应表见 :doc:`Isaac Lab 3.0 迁移指南 "
"<../migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0>` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:623
msgid "Value resolution: USD vs. ActuatorCfg"
msgstr "数值解析：USD 与 ActuatorCfg"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:625
msgid ""
"Gains and limits can come from the USD joint-drive prim or the actuator "
"config. If a config field is ``None``, Isaac Lab uses the USD value. A value"
" set in the config overrides the USD value. The robot schema supplies joint "
"and body ordering, not actuator parameters."
msgstr ""
"增益和限制可以来自 USD 关节驱动 prim，也可以来自执行器配置。配置字段为 ``None`` 时，Isaac Lab 使用 USD "
"值；配置中设置了值时，会覆盖 USD 值。机器人模式只提供关节和刚体的排序，不提供执行器参数。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:629
msgid ""
"Set "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.actuator_value_resolution_debug_print`"
" to ``True`` to log the USD, configuration, and applied values for every "
"joint when the sources differ or the configuration leaves a value "
"unspecified. Unspecified values appear as ``Not Specified``. See :ref:`how-"
"to-write-articulation-config` for examples and the limit table."
msgstr ""
"将 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.actuator_value_resolution_debug_print`"
" 设为 ``True`` ，当来源值不同或配置未指定值时，会记录每个关节的 USD 值、配置值及实际应用值。未指定值显示为 ``Not "
"Specified`` 。示例和限制表见 :ref:`how-to-write-articulation-config` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:638
msgid "Native actuators"
msgstr "原生执行器"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:640
msgid ""
"By default, Isaac Lab uses the native path for supported explicit actuator "
"models. Each explicit model runs either inside the solver or through a "
"shared host adapter. To restore the deprecated Isaac Lab execution path, set"
" :attr:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.use_newton_actuators` to ``False``:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Isaac Lab 对受支持的显式执行器模型使用原生路径，各模型在求解器内或通过共享主机端适配器运行。要恢复已弃用的 Isaac Lab "
"执行路径，将 :attr:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.use_newton_actuators` 设为 ``False``"
" ："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:650
msgid ""
"With the default native path enabled, each supported explicit actuator "
"config becomes a ``NewtonActuator`` USD prim. Newton executes it in the "
"solver. PhysX and OVPhysX execute the same model through the shared host "
"adapter during :meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.write_data_to_sim`."
msgstr ""
"启用默认原生路径后，各受支持的显式执行器配置会生成 ``NewtonActuator`` USD prim。Newton 在求解器中执行它；PhysX "
"和 OVPhysX 则在 :meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.write_data_to_sim` "
"期间通过共享主机端适配器执行同一模型。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:655
msgid ""
"On Newton, native actuators run in the CUDA-graph-captured region. Implicit "
"actuators are unchanged: the solver still applies their PD gains. On CUDA, "
"the host adapter captures actuator staging, model execution, and telemetry "
"publication when possible; otherwise it uses eager execution. Stateful "
"native actuators cannot run in a caller-owned CUDA graph, so the host "
"adapter manages them."
msgstr ""
"在 Newton 上，原生执行器运行于 CUDA 图捕获区域内。隐式执行器保持不变，仍由求解器应用 PD 增益。在 CUDA "
"上，主机端适配器会尽可能捕获执行器指令暂存、模型执行和监测数据发布，否则使用即时执行。有状态的原生执行器不能在调用方管理的 CUDA "
"图中运行，因此由主机端适配器管理。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:660
msgid ""
"Newton executes native actuators in its controller, and the collection "
"exposes that ownership directly: ``robot.actuators[name]`` returns the "
"Newton ``Actuator`` object driving the group's joints instead of an Isaac "
"Lab model. Newton merges structurally identical joints into one actuator, so"
" several groups can share an object (a group spanning several returns them "
"as a tuple). Raw component access reads and writes the controller storage in"
" Newton's layout; for group-scoped access in public joint order, use "
":func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.read_group_parameter` and "
":func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.write_group_parameter`:"
msgstr ""
"Newton 在其控制器中执行原生执行器，集合直接暴露这一归属关系： ``robot.actuators[name]`` 返回驱动该组关节的 "
"Newton ``Actuator`` 对象，而非 Isaac Lab 模型。Newton "
"将结构相同的关节合并到一个执行器中，因此多个组可以共享一个对象（如果一组跨越多个对象，则以元组返回）。直接访问组件时，按 Newton "
"的布局读写控制器存储；要按公共关节顺序访问指定组，请使用 "
":func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.read_group_parameter` 和 "
":func:`~isaaclab.actuators.newton.write_group_parameter` ："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:681
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab retains named groups for configuration, joint bookkeeping, and "
"command and telemetry staging."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 保留命名组，用于配置、关节管理，以及指令和监测数据暂存。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:684
msgid "**Supported models.** Each supported config maps to USD schemas:"
msgstr "**受支持的模型。** 各受支持配置映射到以下 USD 模式："

