msgid "delayed PD + ``NewtonPositionBasedClampingAPI``"
msgstr "延迟 PD + ``NewtonPositionBasedClampingAPI``"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:700
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetMLPCfg` / "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetLSTMCfg`"
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetMLPCfg` / "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorNetLSTMCfg`"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:702
msgid "``NewtonNeuralControlAPI`` (+ ``NewtonDCMotorClampingAPI``)"
msgstr "``NewtonNeuralControlAPI`` （+ ``NewtonDCMotorClampingAPI`` ）"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:704
msgid ""
"**Existing USD actuators.** For joints covered by an explicit Lab actuator "
"config, the config replaces any existing ``NewtonActuator`` prim. Joints not"
" covered by a Lab config keep their USD-authored actuators. USD-authored and"
" Lab-configured actuators can therefore coexist on different joints."
msgstr ""
"**已有的 USD 执行器。** 对显式 Lab 执行器配置覆盖的关节，配置会替换已有的 ``NewtonActuator`` prim。未被 Lab "
"配置覆盖的关节保留其 USD 中编写的执行器。因此，USD 中编写的执行器和 Lab 配置的执行器可以在不同关节上共存。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:711
msgid ""
"With the default ``use_newton_actuators=True``, every explicit actuator "
"config must be supported. An unsupported config raises an error before "
"native authoring. Disable ``use_newton_actuators`` to use the Isaac Lab "
"execution path, or select a supported config."
msgstr ""
"默认设置 ``use_newton_actuators=True`` "
"时，所有显式执行器配置都必须受支持。不受支持的配置会在编写原生执行器前报错。可以禁用 ``use_newton_actuators`` 使用 Isaac"
" Lab 执行路径，或选择受支持的配置。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:717
msgid ""
"Under native execution, delay is fixed. The schema stores only "
"``max_delay``, so ``min_delay`` is ignored. A "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.DelayedPDActuator` does not randomize delay "
"between resets as it does on the Isaac Lab path."
msgstr ""
"原生执行时延迟固定。模式只存储 ``max_delay`` ，因此 ``min_delay`` 被忽略。 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.DelayedPDActuator` 不会像在 Isaac Lab "
"路径中那样，在重置时随机改变延迟。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:723
msgid "Backend submission"
msgstr "提交给后端"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:725
msgid ""
"Submission differs by backend, but the collection interface is the same:"
msgstr "提交方式因后端而异，但集合接口相同："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:731
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:732
msgid "Submit behavior"
msgstr "提交行为"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:733
msgid "PhysX"
msgstr "PhysX"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:734
msgid ""
"The Isaac Lab-managed path pushes processed position, velocity, and effort "
"staging buffers through the PhysX Tensor API. The shared host adapter "
"processes native commands during ``write_data_to_sim()`` and submits raw "
"position and velocity targets plus raw effort. ``applied_effort`` remains "
"telemetry. A fused reorder gather runs first when a non-identity joint "
"ordering is active."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 管理的路径通过 PhysX Tensor API 推送处理后的位置、速度和驱动力暂存缓冲区。共享主机端适配器在 "
"``write_data_to_sim()`` 期间处理原生指令，并提交原始位置、速度目标及原始驱动力。 ``applied_effort`` "
"仍是监测数据。启用非恒等关节排序时，首先执行融合的重排收集操作。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:739
msgid "OVPhysX"
msgstr "OVPhysX"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:740
msgid ""
"The native path uses the shared host adapter during ``write_data_to_sim()``."
" It writes raw position and velocity targets plus raw effort through "
"``set_attribute`` tensor bindings. ``applied_effort`` remains telemetry. Raw"
" setter writes are mirrored into the binding immediately. A fused reorder "
"gather runs first when joint ordering is non-identity."
msgstr ""
"原生路径在 ``write_data_to_sim()`` 期间使用共享主机端适配器，通过 ``set_attribute`` "
"张量绑定写入原始位置、速度目标和原始驱动力。 ``applied_effort`` "
"仍是监测数据。原始设置方法的写入会立即同步到绑定中。关节排序不是恒等排列时，首先执行融合的重排收集操作。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:744
msgid "Newton / MJWarp"
msgstr "Newton / MJWarp"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:745
msgid ""
"Newton writes targets to solver-bound control arrays. Effort is feed-"
"forward, and native actuators also use ``joint_act``. The built-in drive "
"applies PD to implicit joints."
msgstr ""
"Newton 将目标写入与求解器绑定的控制数组。驱动力为前馈量，原生执行器还会使用 ``joint_act`` 。内置驱动对隐式关节应用 PD。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:748
msgid ""
"For explicit actuators, solver stiffness and damping are zero on every "
"backend because the actuator model owns the gains."
msgstr "对于显式执行器，所有后端中的求解器刚度和阻尼均为零，因为增益由执行器模型维护。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:751
msgid "This page does **not** cover:"
msgstr "本页 **不涉及** 以下内容："

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:753
msgid ""
"Motion generators or low-level control modes -- see "
":doc:`/source/concepts/motion_generators`."
msgstr "运动生成器或底层控制模式 — 参见 :doc:`/source/concepts/motion_generators` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:755
msgid ""
"Cross-backend policy transfer and solver-dynamics differences -- see "
":doc:`/source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton`."
msgstr ""
"跨后端策略迁移和求解器动力学差异 — 参见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton` 。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:760
msgid ""
":ref:`how-to-write-articulation-config` -- authoring configs and the full "
"gain/limit value resolution walkthrough."
msgstr ":ref:`how-to-write-articulation-config` — 编写配置，以及增益/限制数值解析的完整说明。"

#: source/concepts/actuators.rst:762
msgid ""
